  "correct": "3",
  "solution": "From the given information:\n\n'÷' stands for 'addition'\n\n'+' stands for 'subtraction'\n\n'×' stands for 'division'\n\n'–' stands for 'multiplication\n\nWe substitute the values in the given options and solve the equation using BODMAS rule:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/13bc0065c96e715682af7c8a6dc1b4c567b7a2a89597cc68809a5ff942c7e421.png] \n\n1) 6 ÷ 8 × 6 – 2 + 9 = 8\n\n 6 + __**8 ÷ 6**__ × 2 - 9 = 8\n\n 6 + __**1.3 × 2**__ - 9 = 8\n\n __**6 + 2.6**__ - 9 = 8\n\n __**8.6 - 9**__ = 8\n\n -0.4 ≠ 8\n\n2) 5 ÷ 12 × 4 – 3 + 8 = 5\n\n 5 + __12 ÷ 4__ × 3 - 8 = 5\n\n 5 + __**3** × 3__ - 8 = 5\n\n __**5** + 9__ - 8 = 5\n\n __14 - 8__ = 5\n\n 6 ≠ 5 \n\n3) 5 ÷ 12 × 4 – 3 + 8 = 6\n\n 5 + __12 ÷ 4__ × 3 - 8 = 6\n\n 5 + __3 × 3__ - 8 = 6\n\n __**5** + 9__ - 8 = 6\n\n __14 - 8__ = 6\n\n 6 = 6 \n\n4) 6 ÷ 8 × 6 – 2 + 9 =4\n\n 6 + __8 ÷ 6__ × 2 - 9 = 4\n\n 6 + __1.3 × 2__ - 9 = 4\n\n __6 + 2.6__ - 9 = 4\n\n __8.6 - 9__ = 4\n\n -0.4 ≠ 4\n\nHence **the correct answer is option 3)**",
